  "question": {
    "text": "A convex lens of focal length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>cm</mi></math> and image formed by it, is at least distance of distinct vision then the magnifying power is"
